# Code owners for this repository (the dotnet new template itself).
#
# Owners are auto-requested as reviewers when a PR touches their paths. Nothing
# here blocks a merge until branch protection turns on "Require review from Code
# Owners" — until then these are advisory routing.
#
# Last match wins, so the specific entries below override the default.
#
# Stamped apps get their own copy from stamp/.github/CODEOWNERS.

# Default owner for anything not matched more specifically.
*                           @rvaanthony

# --- Templating mechanics ---------------------------------------------------
# The option matrix, the parameter symbols, and which files ship. A change here
# affects every future stamped app, and the blast radius is not visible from the
# diff alone.
